1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,730
This robot uses other robots

2
00:00:01,730 --> 00:00:03,240
as spare body parts.

3
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:04,730
It’s built from motorized rods

4
00:00:04,730 --> 00:00:06,180
that stretch and shrink,

5
00:00:06,180 --> 00:00:07,840
with magnets at their ends.

6
00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:09,480
A person controls the movements,

7
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:11,520
guiding another rod into place.

8
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:12,510
Once it connects,

9
00:00:12,510 --> 00:00:13,250
that extra piece

10
00:00:13,250 --> 00:00:14,610
becomes a walking stick,

11
00:00:14,610 --> 00:00:15,330
helping the robot

12
00:00:15,330 --> 00:00:17,050
move faster downhill.

13
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:18,480
And if a part stops working,

14
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:19,200
it can drop it

15
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:20,800
and attach a replacement.

16
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:23,260
So that broken robot beside it…

17
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:25,240
could become its next body part.

